# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git LFS legacy — read before adding an image
#
# This file previously carried Hugging Face dataset boilerplate that routed
# *.png/*.jpg (and dozens of ML formats that never existed here) through Git
# LFS, plus path rules for data/ and graph_output/ which are not tracked at all.
# All of that has been removed: new binaries are committed as ordinary blobs.
#
# The 13 PNGs already committed under capstone_report/images/ and
# notebooks/eda/output/ remain stored as LFS objects from that era. Working
# copies of them are 130-byte pointer stubs unless you have git-lfs installed
# and have run `git lfs pull`.
#
# WARNING: if you do NOT have git-lfs installed, never `git add` or `git mv`
# one of those PNGs. Without the LFS filter your 130-byte pointer stub would be
# committed as the image itself, destroying the figure. Install git-lfs and
# fetch the real bytes first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
